<p style="position: absolute; left: 44px; right: 36px; top: 44%; margin: 0; font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.3; color: #d9d8d2">Let yourself be exactly who you are.</p>
